#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:597
msgid "Calendar integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:599
msgid "The Mail app integrates with the Calendar app to help you manage meeting invitations and keep your calendar up to date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:602
msgid "Meeting invitations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:604
msgid "When you receive a message containing a meeting invitation, the Mail app automatically detects the attached calendar file and displays a formatted action section to help you respond."
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:606
msgid "You can:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:608
msgid "**Accept** the invitation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:609
msgid "**Decline** the invitation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:610
msgid "**Tentatively accept** the invitation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:612
msgid "Your response is sent directly from the Mail app, and the event is added to your primary calendar accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:614
msgid "You can also manually add a meeting invitation to a specific calendar:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:616
msgid "Open the message with the meeting invitation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:617
msgid "Scroll to the bottom of the message to the attachments section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:618
msgid "Select the calendar file (usually with a .ics extension), then click the three dots menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:619
msgid "Click \"Import in to calendar\" and choose the desired calendar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:622
msgid "Meeting invitation automation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:624
msgid "When a meeting organizer sends updates to an existing event (such as time changes or location updates), the Mail app processes these automatically and updates the corresponding event in your calendar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:628
msgid "You can also configure Mail to automatically add all new meeting invitations to your calendar without requiring manual acceptance. The invitations will be added to the calendar as tentative."
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:630
msgid "To enable this feature:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:632
msgid "Visit account settings of a specific mail account"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:633
msgid "Navigate to Calendar settings section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:634
msgid "Enable *Automatically create tentative appointments in calendar*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../groupware/mail.rst:636
msgid "With this setting enabled, invitations will still appear in your mail list, but they will be automatically added to your calendar."
msgstr ""

